gent:T8","usage":{"input_tokens":404348,"output_tokens":3898,"requests":12}}],"version":1},"findings":[{"block_threshold":0.95,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Add an acceptance-criterion proving check (jq or unit assertion on the labels-<hash>.jsonl) for completion_failed_after_pass, clean_close, and the persisted/resolved_by_author finding join, not only plan_defect/caused_by/reopen.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5a","T5e","T7"],"criteria":["E6","E1"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":0.05,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["'Every review/finding in the verified corpus carries the labels above, with source event ids; checked by report counts matching independent jq counts for plan_defect, caused_by, reopen events.'","Approach defines completion_failed_after_pass, clean_close, persisted, resolved_by_author, noise_flip as additional labels not named in the jq spot-check."],"finding":"AC1's independent jq verification covers only plan_defect, caused_by, and reopen events, but the plan defines several other labels (completion_failed_after_pass, clean_close, persisted, resolved_by_author, noise_flip) whose correctness is not independently proven by any acceptance criterion.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fa0a2fd4dda6f42e7","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Acceptance Criteria, first bullet","norm_id":"n3b1881ce8c052d68","priority":1.0,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A bug in completion_failed_after_pass ordering (ns comparison) or in the persisted/resolved_by_author join ships undetected because no AC-level check exercises it beyond the unit fixtures."],"severity":"critical","suggested_fix":"Extend AC1 (or add an AC) to assert report counts for every emitted label against jq counts over the labels JSONL, e.g. jq -e 'select(.label==\"clean_close\")' cardinality checks.","tier":"LLM","validity":1.0,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_conf